# Upstream pins. Single source of truth for scripts; the engine rev is also
# pinned in crates/*/Cargo.toml (it must equal the wrapper's own Cargo pin).
# Our fork: upstream prog + engine master pin (branch drip/engine-master).
# We re-pin ourselves instead of waiting for upstream prog to.
